     │                                                                                                                                                      ╰─── `choose b (arg => Parse.exactly 340282366920938463463374607431768211456 Parse.digit)` and `arg => Parse.exactly 35 Parse.digit` aren't equal
     │
     ├─[ std/Parse/Parse.sw:219:31 ]
